; Ledgera sample journal for local testing.
; The file intentionally covers common hledger scenarios: commodities,
; statuses, transaction codes, multi-posting entries, balancing postings,
; investment lots with unit prices, and posting comments.
; It includes both past-month entries and current-month entries.

commodity €
commodity $
commodity VWCE

